{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Raw and Derived Attributes.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Raw and Derived Attributes.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"raw and derived attributes raw and derived attributes","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Raw and Derived Attributes.md","fileName":"Raw and Derived Attributes.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Raw and Derived Attributes","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 09:06\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Data Science Framing and Representation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Science Framing and Representation","datascience_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Raw and Derived Attributes.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Raw and Derived Attributes.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"raw and derived attributes raw and derived attributes","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Raw and Derived Attributes.md","fileName":"Raw and Derived Attributes.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Raw and Derived Attributes","heading":"Raw and Derived Attributes","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A raw attribute is recorded directly from a source; a derived attribute is calculated from other fields. Derivation can encode a meaningful interaction that no single raw field expresses. The book uses body mass index, calculated from weight and height, to illustrate how a combined measure may relate more strongly to a study target than either input alone.\n\nDerived features still need domain scrutiny. A useful calculation for one setting may be unhelpful elsewhere, and an inappropriate transformation can hide differences. Feature design is part of representing the problem, not just a technical optimization after data collection.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Science Framing and Representation","datascience_mit.epub"],"